 "phrases": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "text": "Imagine pointing a powerful laser at the moon.",
   "start": 0.01,
   "end": 2.97,
   "first": 0,
   "last": 7,
   "ends_with": "."
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "text": "Not to light it up.",
   "start": 3.88,
   "end": 4.71,
   "first": 8,
   "last": 12,
   "ends_with": "."
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "text": "To ask it a question.",
   "start": 5.56,
   "end": 6.52,
   "first": 13,
   "last": 17,
   "ends_with": "."
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "text": "You fire a pulse at a reflector sitting on the lunar surface.",
   "start": 7.62,
   "end": 11.04,
   "first": 18,
   "last": 29,
   "ends_with": "."
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "text": "Now,",
   "start": 11.84,
   "end": 12.01,
   "first": 30,
   "last": 30,
   "ends_with": ","
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "text": "how long before that light comes home?",
   "start": 12.39,
   "end": 14.77,
   "first": 31,
   "last": 37,
   "ends_with": "?"
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "text": "About two and a half seconds.",
   "start": 15.99,
   "end": 17.14,
   "first": 38,
   "last": 43,
   "ends_with": "."
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "text": "Wait, that's there and back. Not two and a half seconds each way.",
   "start": 17.68,
   "end": 21.12,
   "first": 44,
   "last": 56,
   "ends_with": "."
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "text": "A little over a second to reach the moon",
   "start": 21.9,
   "end": 23.5,
   "first": 57,
   "last": 65,
   "ends_with": ""
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "text": "and a little over a second to return.",
   "start": 23.8,
   "end": 25.48,
   "first": 66,
   "last": 73,
   "ends_with": "."
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "text": "And because the moon's distance keeps changing,",
   "start": 26.26,
   "end": 28.65,
   "first": 74,
   "last": 80,
   "ends_with": ","
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "text": "the timing changes too.",
   "start": 28.93,
   "end": 30.22,
   "first": 81,
   "last": 84,
   "ends_with": "."
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "text": "But hold on.",
   "start": 31.16,
   "end": 31.58,
   "first": 85,
   "last": 87,
   "ends_with": "."
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "text": "Why would the light come back at all?",
   "start": 32.37,
   "end": 34.07,
   "first": 88,
   "last": 95,
   "ends_with": "?"
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "text": "Did someone leave a mirror on the moon?",
   "start": 35.02,
   "end": 37.04,
   "first": 96,
   "last": 103,
   "ends_with": "?"
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "text": "Actually,",
   "start": 38.26,
   "end": 38.64,
   "first": 104,
   "last": 104,
   "ends_with": ","
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "text": "yes.",
   "start": 39.14,
   "end": 39.55,
   "first": 105,
   "last": 105,
   "ends_with": "."
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "text": "Apollo astronauts left special reflectors on the lunar surface.",
   "start": 40.08,
   "end": 43.69,
   "first": 106,
   "last": 114,
   "ends_with": "."
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "text": "Their corners have a clever trick.",
   "start": 44.32,
   "end": 46.06,
   "first": 115,
   "last": 120,
   "ends_with": "."
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "text": "They redirect a tiny fraction of incoming light back toward where it came from.",
   "start": 46.37,
   "end": 50.69,
   "first": 121,
   "last": 134,
   "ends_with": "."
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "text": "Back on Earth, a telescope looks for the return.",
   "start": 51.61,
   "end": 53.92,
   "first": 135,
   "last": 143,
   "ends_with": "."
  },
  {
   "i": 21,
   "text": "And here's the really strange part.",
   "start": 54.7,
   "end": 56.72,
   "first": 144,
   "last": 149,
   "ends_with": "."
  },
  {
   "i": 22,
   "text": "Almost none of the light makes it back to the detector.",
   "start": 57.6,
   "end": 60.05,
   "first": 150,
   "last": 160,
   "ends_with": "."
  },
  {
   "i": 23,
   "text": "Scientists have to collect just a few returning photons from many laser pulses.",
   "start": 60.64,
   "end": 65.33,
   "first": 161,
   "last": 173,
   "ends_with": "."
  },
  {
   "i": 24,
   "text": "A few photons.",
   "start": 65.92,
   "end": 67.11,
   "first": 174,
   "last": 176,
   "ends_with": "."
  },
  {
   "i": 25,
   "text": "They even account for the effects of Earth's atmosphere.",
   "start": 67.74,
   "end": 70.0,
   "first": 177,
   "last": 185,
   "ends_with": "."
  },
  {
   "i": 26,
   "text": "And",
   "start": 71.0,
   "end": 71.14,
   "first": 186,
   "last": 186,
   "ends_with": ""
  },
  {
   "i": 27,
   "text": "somehow,",
   "start": 71.46,
   "end": 72.05,
   "first": 187,
   "last": 187,
   "ends_with": ","
  },
  {
   "i": 28,
   "text": "those incredibly faint returns let them measure the distance with remarkable precision.",
   "start": 72.48,
   "end": 76.99,
   "first": 188,
   "last": 199,
   "ends_with": "."
  },
  {
   "i": 29,
   "text": "So how does it work?",
   "start": 78.1,
   "end": 79.18,
   "first": 200,
   "last": 204,
   "ends_with": "?"
  },
  {
   "i": 30,
   "text": "A cosmic stopwatch.",
   "start": 80.06,
   "end": 81.12,
   "first": 205,
   "last": 207,
   "ends_with": "."
  },
  {
   "i": 31,
   "text": "Take the round trip time,",
   "start": 81.78,
   "end": 82.82,
   "first": 208,
   "last": 212,
   "ends_with": ","
  },
  {
   "i": 32,
   "text": "multiply it by the speed of light,",
   "start": 83.23,
   "end": 84.56,
   "first": 213,
   "last": 219,
   "ends_with": ","
  },
  {
   "i": 33,
   "text": "then divide by two.",
   "start": 85.12,
   "end": 85.94,
   "first": 220,
   "last": 223,
   "ends_with": "."
  },
  {
   "i": 34,
   "text": "That's your distance.",
   "start": 86.93,
   "end": 87.64,
   "first": 224,
   "last": 226,
   "ends_with": "."
  },
  {
   "i": 35,
   "text": "The moon isn't just hanging in the sky.",
   "start": 89.11,
   "end": 91.18,
   "first": 227,
   "last": 234,
   "ends_with": "."
  },
  {
   "i": 36,
   "text": "With each faint return,",
   "start": 92.09,
   "end": 93.25,
   "first": 235,
   "last": 238,
   "ends_with": ","
  },
  {
   "i": 37,
   "text": "we can measure where it is.",
   "start": 94.01,
   "end": 95.11,
   "first": 239,
   "last": 244,
   "ends_with": "."
  }
 ],
